{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10351410","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10351410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1035141001:1":{"text":"There are quite a few golems ahead, and they frequently attack travelers.","source_cn":"前面有不少魔偶在游荡，他们经常会袭击过路的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44A16E01EC35B6EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035141002:1":{"text":"This stretch of road is very dangerous. I heard nearby villagers have been moving away...","source_cn":"这段路太不安全了，听说附近的村民都陆陆续续地搬走了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6517561478DA1BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1035141002":{"text":"This stretch of road is very dangerous. I heard nearby villagers have been moving away...","source_cn":"这段路太不安全了，听说附近的村民都陆陆续续地搬走了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6517561478DA1BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035141003:1":{"text":"I haven't seen anything myself. But according to others...","source_cn":"我并没有见过。不过，听其他人说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D9383667CEBC346","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1035141004:1":{"text":"They're terrifying mechanical monsters! Dura above, I hope they won't enter Holistone.","source_cn":"是很可